WEBVTT

00:13.000 --> 00:18.250
<b>I'm gonna master this world alone!</b>

00:22.580 --> 00:23.420
<b>PERCEPTION</b>

00:28.670 --> 00:29.250
<b>Huh?</b>

00:31.380 --> 00:32.170
<b>What?</b>

00:33.960 --> 00:35.790
<b>Is it just me or did I hear a voice?</b>

00:35.790 --> 00:36.670
<b>Seriously?</b>

00:38.830 --> 00:40.630
<b>Shoot!</b>

00:40.630 --> 00:43.830
<b>I was enjoying the solitude so much
I forgot about these guys!</b>

00:45.170 --> 00:48.330
<b>I swear I heard it right 'round here.</b>

02:33.330 --> 02:37.040
<b>Reunion</b>

02:34.790 --> 02:36.880
<b>The hell? Don't spook us like that.</b>

02:37.210 --> 02:38.130
<b>Let's get outta here.</b>

02:45.670 --> 02:46.790
<b>That was close.</b>

02:52.130 --> 02:56.710
<b>I want nothing to do with these delinquents,
but I gotta know what they're talking about.</b>

02:57.540 --> 03:00.380
<b>Know what I've been reminded of since we got here?</b>

03:01.130 --> 03:04.250
<b>The huge rack our class vice rep's got!</b>

03:04.250 --> 03:05.500
<b>Seriously, though!</b>

03:05.500 --> 03:08.040
<b>Whole new world and they still stand out!</b>

03:08.540 --> 03:11.170
<b>They're just horny for the girls!</b>

03:11.460 --> 03:13.540
<b>Knew these guys were a bunch of creeps.</b>

03:13.960 --> 03:15.960
<b>I'm more into the swim team!</b>

03:15.960 --> 03:17.000
<b>Those legs!</b>

03:17.000 --> 03:18.380
<b>Hard to beat!</b>

03:20.130 --> 03:23.170
<b>The girls have the class rep on their side.</b>

03:23.420 --> 03:25.500
<b>Even if they try and stir up trouble...</b>

03:25.880 --> 03:27.880
<b>Hey! Hold it right there!</b>

03:28.330 --> 03:33.710
<b>I mean, she's like a super hero who has shut down
trouble makers since elementary school.</b>

03:34.000 --> 03:37.500
<b>I can't take that</b>

03:34.000 --> 03:37.500
<b>much praise!</b>

03:34.380 --> 03:36.290
<b>I can't take that much praise!</b>

03:39.460 --> 03:40.420
<b>Hey, Tanaka!</b>

03:41.250 --> 03:44.210
<b>This skill's gonna let us do as we please, yeah?</b>

03:44.710 --> 03:45.960
<b>I-I think so...</b>

03:45.960 --> 03:47.500
<b>Okay, Tanaka!</b>

03:47.750 --> 03:49.540
<b>Now tell us how it works!</b>

03:52.580 --> 03:55.210
<b>Is that...Tanaka?</b>

03:55.210 --> 03:58.000
<b>They're using him like a living G**gle search.</b>

03:58.460 --> 03:59.790
<b>Let's head back.</b>

04:01.460 --> 04:05.710
<b>Bet the vice rep's waiting for me. Probably.</b>

04:05.920 --> 04:07.540
<b>Probably my ass!</b>

04:15.750 --> 04:18.290
<b>Guess that means the whole class is upstream.</b>

04:20.580 --> 04:23.250
<b>But solo's the way to go!</b>

04:29.170 --> 04:30.460
<b>No way...</b>

04:31.920 --> 04:33.960
<b>My Loner level just went up!</b>

04:34.880 --> 04:37.750
<b>Is this because I avoided my classmates?</b>

04:38.460 --> 04:42.330
<b>If NEET had leveled up too after all that hard work,
I would have broken down right here.</b>

04:43.040 --> 04:46.000
<b>These titles really wreck your self-confidence.</b>

04:46.880 --> 04:49.830
<b>But I'm still only at level 3 myself.</b>

04:50.170 --> 04:53.750
<b>That's probably because of these
Master of None and Dummy skills.</b>

04:54.580 --> 04:57.170
<b>I knew they'd be hard to level up.</b>

04:58.000 --> 04:59.710
<b>I dunno what they even do...</b>

05:00.290 --> 05:04.040
<b>Master of None likely means I can't stay focused on
any one thing long enough to hit it big.</b>

05:04.960 --> 05:08.330
<b>But it does let me handle most things pretty well.</b>

05:08.880 --> 05:11.670
<b>Does "Dummy" make me some kinda puppet?</b>

05:11.880 --> 05:13.790
<b>Or is it dummy as in useless idiot?</b>

05:14.040 --> 05:16.500
<b>This one's bad! Probably the worst!</b>

05:17.500 --> 05:20.290
<b>Screw it! Time to eat my troubles away!</b>

05:21.330 --> 05:23.750
<b>Still mushrooms, though...</b>

05:24.080 --> 05:27.290
<b>Forget meat, I'd settle for some fish.</b>

05:28.040 --> 05:35.540
<b>DAY 7</b>

05:39.170 --> 05:41.040
<b>Jeez! Enough!</b>

05:42.210 --> 05:45.460
<b>Is this those delinquents again?
It's the middle of the night!</b>

05:45.460 --> 05:47.750
<b>Isn't it past their bed time?</b>

05:51.250 --> 05:52.460
<b>Any MP? Still nothing?!</b>

05:52.460 --> 05:54.170
<b>Not yet! Hang in there!</b>

05:54.170 --> 05:56.330
<b>Stand back, I'll hold 'em!</b>

05:56.330 --> 05:57.420
<b>I can still take it!</b>

05:57.920 --> 05:59.790
<b>Oh, it's the nerds.</b>

06:00.580 --> 06:03.540
<b>Kids these days, always causing a ruckus!</b>

06:04.420 --> 06:06.420
<b>Looks like they're in a bind.</b>

06:06.420 --> 06:07.790
<b>Maybe I should help?</b>

06:07.960 --> 06:10.330
<b>APPRAISAL</b>

06:10.330 --> 06:11.790
<b>SORCERER</b>

06:10.920 --> 06:13.080
<b>Wait, they don't need help!</b>

06:11.790 --> 06:13.460
<b>SAINT</b>

06:13.330 --> 06:15.420
<b>They've got way better classes than me!</b>

06:13.580 --> 06:15.830
<b>GUARDIAN</b>

06:16.000 --> 06:17.920
<b>Why am I the only NEET here?</b>

06:17.080 --> 06:18.330
<b>SHINOBI</b>

06:18.540 --> 06:23.750
<b>Oh, right. They're not stuck with crap like me.
They've got the OP stuff.</b>

06:23.960 --> 06:25.210
<b>It's just like...</b>

06:27.580 --> 06:32.830
<b>Our class was full of top athletes and ace students.</b>

06:32.830 --> 06:35.130
<b>Kids of celebrities and stuff, too.</b>

06:35.380 --> 06:39.540
<b>Used to wonder how a normal kid
like me wound up there.</b>

06:42.250 --> 06:45.830
<b>But these nerds are isekai pros.</b>

06:45.830 --> 06:46.790
<b>They'll be fine.</b>

06:47.790 --> 06:48.630
<b>PERCEPTION</b>

06:49.130 --> 06:52.290
<b>Freakin' goblins. Attacking from behind's not fair.</b>

06:56.920 --> 07:00.330
<b>Gah, fine. So be it!</b>

07:06.580 --> 07:08.630
<b>Stick attack!</b>

07:12.500 --> 07:15.580
<b>Heya, Nerd Corps. You holdin' up?</b>

07:17.460 --> 07:19.880
<b>Wait, Haruka?!</b>

07:22.670 --> 07:25.040
<b>Thanks, you really saved us!</b>

07:25.330 --> 07:26.380
<b>Thanks!</b>

07:26.710 --> 07:29.830
<b>No, uhh... No need to thank me...</b>

07:31.290 --> 07:35.000
<b>Yikes. Been alone so long I forget how to talk.</b>

07:38.580 --> 07:39.580
<b>C'mon in.</b>

07:40.540 --> 07:41.540
<b>Whoa!</b>

07:42.000 --> 07:43.880
<b>When did caves get so fancy?</b>

07:45.580 --> 07:46.250
<b>Cool!</b>

07:46.250 --> 07:48.920
<b>I just learned earth magic, see?</b>

07:48.920 --> 07:51.460
<b>So I paired that with my Packing skill...</b>

07:51.460 --> 07:53.420
<b>Wow, it's impressive!</b>

07:53.750 --> 07:55.210
<b>You did this all alone?</b>

07:55.750 --> 07:57.710
<b>Why ask? I'm always alone!</b>

07:59.750 --> 08:01.670
<b>This place is huge!</b>

08:01.670 --> 08:03.250
<b>It's not fair you get it all to yourself!</b>

08:03.500 --> 08:05.960
<b>So, what happened to everyone else?</b>

08:06.750 --> 08:08.500
<b>What are you up to at night alone?</b>

08:09.420 --> 08:11.420
<b>Well, uhh...</b>

08:11.790 --> 08:13.210
<b>You see...</b>

08:15.250 --> 08:16.420
<b>We're on the run.</b>

08:17.040 --> 08:17.710
<b>What?!</b>

08:20.920 --> 08:24.170
<b>On the run? What happened?</b>

08:25.210 --> 08:26.130
<b>Well...</b>

08:29.040 --> 08:34.170
<b>Apparently it all started when everyone
but me got transported to the forest.</b>

08:34.670 --> 08:36.040
<b>Wh-where are we?</b>

08:36.040 --> 08:38.080
<b>Are we really in another world?</b>

08:38.080 --> 08:41.420
<b>So that old guy was telling the truth?!</b>

08:43.750 --> 08:45.250
<b>I wanna go home!</b>

08:45.380 --> 08:47.000
<b>Mommy!</b>

08:48.830 --> 08:51.080
<b>Ugh, this totally sucks.</b>

08:51.290 --> 08:54.750
<b>Now what? I know nothing about these isekai!</b>

08:55.290 --> 08:57.250
<b>Hey, I bet we can use this stat!</b>

08:57.250 --> 08:59.330
<b>Seen that skill in a light novel, too!</b>

09:00.420 --> 09:04.630
<b>Hey, nerds! Tell us all you know,
or I'm gonna pummel you!</b>

09:05.250 --> 09:07.080
<b>So this is an isekai...</b>

09:07.080 --> 09:10.710
<b>Uhh, Class Rep? You can be more surprised than that!</b>

09:11.540 --> 09:12.710
<b>I gotta pee!</b>

09:12.710 --> 09:14.250
<b>Whadda we do?!</b>

09:14.710 --> 09:16.630
<b>I want some fish...</b>

09:16.630 --> 09:19.750
<b>It's so hot! I wanna get outta my uniform!</b>

09:19.960 --> 09:22.040
<b>E-everyone settle down.</b>

09:22.040 --> 09:25.330
<b>I know you're scared, but if
we're too loud out in these woods...</b>

09:25.540 --> 09:28.040
<b>C-Class Rep! Behind you...</b>

09:28.210 --> 09:28.920
<b>Huh?</b>

09:35.710 --> 09:38.170
<b>Not even she could hold it together at such a sight.</b>

09:38.830 --> 09:40.790
<b>You held up long enough, though!</b>

09:46.250 --> 09:48.830
<b>Quiet already, you've got monsters incoming!</b>

09:48.830 --> 09:50.380
<b>Scary enough to make bears look cute!</b>

09:52.250 --> 09:53.330
<b>Go away!</b>

09:53.330 --> 09:56.420
<b>The delinquents, too? Ever seen such a load of idiots?</b>

09:57.420 --> 10:00.170
<b>Goblins, huh? Piece of cake.</b>

10:19.710 --> 10:21.040
<b>L-let's help 'em!</b>

10:21.040 --> 10:22.170
<b>Here we go!</b>

10:23.420 --> 10:24.420
<b>All right!</b>

10:27.210 --> 10:32.000
<b>The jocks apparently made a brave stand too,
and the monsters were defeated.</b>

10:33.670 --> 10:38.580
<b>L-listen! We need to move
somewhere safer with more visibility!</b>

10:38.920 --> 10:40.080
<b>G-good point.</b>

10:40.080 --> 10:40.790
<b>Let's hurry.</b>

10:40.790 --> 10:42.380
<b>Quickly, now!</b>

10:42.960 --> 10:48.170
<b>With her wits back, the Class Rep
led everyone to a safe riverside clearing.</b>

10:51.540 --> 10:53.500
<b>Try standing the wood up some more.</b>

10:53.880 --> 10:55.710
<b>According to my light novels...</b>

10:55.710 --> 11:00.500
<b>The nerds used their isekai and
survival knowledge to help everyone set up camp.</b>

11:01.710 --> 11:07.960
<b>NIGHT WATCH</b>

11:01.710 --> 11:07.960
<b>COOKING</b>

11:01.710 --> 11:07.960
<b>GATHERING</b>

11:01.710 --> 11:07.960
<b>SURVEYING</b>

11:01.710 --> 11:07.960
<b>DAY WATCH</b>

11:02.000 --> 11:04.500
<b>Apparently, the Class Rep organized things</b>

11:04.500 --> 11:06.670
<b>and put everyone to work.</b>

11:08.250 --> 11:11.420
<b>Okay, please take watch and help with cooking.</b>

11:11.750 --> 11:13.710
<b>Everyone else help set up tents.</b>

11:13.710 --> 11:14.460
<b>Got it.</b>

11:14.460 --> 11:15.630
<b>I'll keep an eye out.</b>

11:15.630 --> 11:17.170
<b>I'll go find fish!</b>

11:17.170 --> 11:18.960
<b>I wanna build a bath, too!</b>

11:22.080 --> 11:25.580
<b>And with that they all came together
and worked as one...</b>

11:28.330 --> 11:29.580
<b>Or so it seemed.</b>

11:34.330 --> 11:35.920
<b>Know what? No.</b>

11:36.500 --> 11:39.670
<b>Like, why should we have to do this?</b>

11:40.000 --> 11:41.830
<b>I don't want to set up any tents.</b>

11:41.830 --> 11:43.130
<b>Count me out.</b>

11:44.830 --> 11:45.880
<b>Hey, wait!</b>

11:46.380 --> 11:49.540
<b>I'll help, too! We can do this! Okay?</b>

11:50.040 --> 11:50.670
<b>Not happening.</b>

11:51.460 --> 11:53.170
<b>No means no.</b>

11:53.630 --> 11:54.540
<b>But...</b>

11:55.500 --> 11:57.540
<b>Count us out too, then.</b>

11:57.540 --> 11:59.420
<b>Leave it to the nerds!</b>

11:59.960 --> 12:02.080
<b>D-don't be like that!</b>

12:02.380 --> 12:04.540
<b>Let's all work together!</b>

12:04.540 --> 12:05.920
<b>I'm out too, then.</b>

12:05.920 --> 12:06.830
<b>I've had enough.</b>

12:06.830 --> 12:07.880
<b>Too much work.</b>

12:08.130 --> 12:09.080
<b>This sucks.</b>

12:09.080 --> 12:10.540
<b>You all handle it.</b>

12:10.540 --> 12:11.420
<b>You do it!</b>

12:13.130 --> 12:15.790
<b>How did this happen?</b>

12:18.710 --> 12:21.420
<b>And just like that, the class fell apart.</b>

12:28.500 --> 12:34.170
<b>From that point on, only the Class Rep, the nerds,
and a few other students did any work.</b>

12:36.630 --> 12:38.210
<b>Why's it only us?</b>

12:38.920 --> 12:40.290
<b>I'm so bored!</b>

12:40.290 --> 12:41.670
<b>This place sucks.</b>

12:41.960 --> 12:43.170
<b>It's so lame.</b>

12:43.170 --> 12:44.670
<b>Work if you're bored!</b>

12:44.670 --> 12:47.420
<b>I work my butt off yet I'm still a NEET!</b>

12:50.170 --> 12:52.420
<b>Hold strong! Don't let them in camp!</b>

12:52.880 --> 12:54.960
<b>Meanwhile, the nerds worked way too much.</b>

12:55.250 --> 12:57.210
<b>They were stuck with handling monsters, too!</b>

13:02.790 --> 13:05.170
<b>It's rough, but we need to grind and level up.</b>

13:05.960 --> 13:08.960
<b>CHARM</b>

13:06.210 --> 13:10.500
<b>"Charm" probably grants control over people,
and then there's Puppeteer...</b>

13:08.960 --> 13:11.960
<b>PUPPETEER</b>

13:10.500 --> 13:11.630
<b>That's definitely bad news.</b>

13:12.250 --> 13:15.830
<b>I saw the delinquents pick
those skills back in the white room.</b>

13:16.420 --> 13:22.670
<b>That explained it. They were leveling up to stand up
to the delinquents' wicked choice of skills.</b>

13:28.250 --> 13:30.170
<b>We gotta level up, too!</b>

13:30.250 --> 13:33.080
<b>Can't use our skills till we do!</b>

13:33.330 --> 13:35.750
<b>The nerds kept close eyes on the delinquents.</b>

13:36.080 --> 13:38.960
<b>That's when they heard them
blab about their harem plan.</b>

13:39.130 --> 13:41.040
<b>First I'm goin' for the vice rep...</b>

13:41.040 --> 13:43.330
<b>I'm gonna make the class rep submit to me...</b>

13:44.710 --> 13:46.920
<b>Why would they just talk about it all in the open?</b>

13:46.920 --> 13:48.210
<b>Did they WANT to be caught?!</b>

13:50.920 --> 13:53.170
<b>Class Rep! We have a problem!</b>

13:53.420 --> 13:58.210
<b>Once the nerds told her,
the Class Rep decided something had to be done.</b>

13:58.380 --> 14:01.710
<b>If that's the case, I need to level up, too!</b>

14:02.540 --> 14:07.290
<b>But the delinquents managed to use
Charm and Puppeteer just a few days later.</b>

14:06.250 --> 14:09.210
<b>Level Up</b>

14:06.250 --> 14:09.210
<b>Level Up</b>

14:07.000 --> 14:09.210
<b>PUPPETEER</b>

14:07.210 --> 14:09.210
<b>CHARM</b>

14:07.540 --> 14:08.130
<b>YES!</b>

14:08.130 --> 14:08.790
<b>YEAH!</b>

14:08.790 --> 14:09.210
<b>Nice one!</b>

14:11.670 --> 14:14.330
<b>And our Class Rep happened on them right that moment.</b>

14:14.670 --> 14:16.420
<b>Like a pig to the slaughter...</b>

14:19.580 --> 14:21.380
<b>Class Rep! Run for it!</b>

14:24.880 --> 14:29.080
<b>A few seconds later, all the delinquents
were down and apparently unable to move.</b>

14:30.580 --> 14:31.960
<b>N-now's our chance!</b>

14:31.960 --> 14:34.330
<b>Use your seal ability on their Charm and Puppeteer
skills!</b>

14:35.460 --> 14:40.880
<b>Once their forced harem plans were exposed,
the delinquents were run out of the camp.</b>

14:41.380 --> 14:42.250
<b>Unbelievable.</b>

14:42.250 --> 14:43.330
<b>They're no allies!</b>

14:43.330 --> 14:44.380
<b>I don't even want to LOOK at you.</b>

14:44.380 --> 14:45.380
<b>Get lost.</b>

14:45.380 --> 14:47.460
<b>Dammit! You're gonna pay for this!</b>

14:48.170 --> 14:51.210
<b>You'd think the rest lived happily ever after, but...</b>

14:53.170 --> 14:53.920
<b>Hiyah!</b>

14:53.920 --> 14:55.170
<b>Payback time!</b>

14:55.460 --> 14:57.130
<b>The nerds are gonna get it worst!</b>

14:57.130 --> 15:01.130
<b>They ran us out! Give 'em hell!</b>

15:02.250 --> 15:02.880
<b>Stop!</b>

15:02.880 --> 15:03.540
<b>Cut it out!</b>

15:03.540 --> 15:04.630
<b>What are you thinking?!</b>

15:04.830 --> 15:05.790
<b>C'mon, now!</b>

15:05.790 --> 15:06.580
<b>Piece o' crap!</b>

15:06.580 --> 15:07.380
<b>How's it feel?</b>

15:07.710 --> 15:11.000
<b>This is some serious delinquency!
I thought they were supposed to just LOOK the part!</b>

15:14.920 --> 15:15.790
<b>Put out the fires!</b>

15:15.790 --> 15:16.670
<b>It's too late!</b>

15:16.670 --> 15:17.380
<b>This is bad!</b>

15:17.880 --> 15:18.750
<b>No!</b>

15:19.920 --> 15:21.330
<b>Now that's more like it.</b>

15:21.330 --> 15:22.540
<b>We'll be back!</b>

15:23.080 --> 15:24.290
<b>Suckers.</b>

15:29.040 --> 15:31.330
<b>O-our camp...</b>

15:31.330 --> 15:33.250
<b>After all our hard work...</b>

15:34.920 --> 15:37.750
<b>For some reason, the nerds took
all the blame for what happened.</b>

15:38.130 --> 15:40.750
<b>The gal gang really let 'em have it.</b>

15:41.670 --> 15:43.670
<b>This is all cause you picked a fight!</b>

15:44.040 --> 15:47.420
<b>You shoulda known your place!
How are you gonna fix this?</b>

15:47.420 --> 15:49.290
<b>You stupid, idiotic, anti-socials!</b>

15:49.290 --> 15:50.130
<b>Yeah, seriously!</b>

15:50.130 --> 15:51.130
<b>This is your fault!</b>

15:51.130 --> 15:51.880
<b>How you gonna fix this?</b>

15:51.880 --> 15:52.670
<b>Own up!</b>

15:53.330 --> 15:54.960
<b>What? No...</b>

15:57.130 --> 16:00.790
<b>H-hang on, Oda's group did nothing wrong!</b>

16:01.170 --> 16:04.330
<b>Our Class Rep and a few other students took their side,</b>

16:04.330 --> 16:07.830
<b>but it was all too much to take, so the nerds took off.</b>

16:10.880 --> 16:12.000
<b>You guys!</b>

16:12.290 --> 16:13.920
<b>You've been through so much!</b>

16:13.920 --> 16:15.420
<b>It must have been rough!</b>

16:15.670 --> 16:16.920
<b>W-well...</b>

16:16.920 --> 16:20.080
<b>All right! Tonight we feast!</b>

16:20.080 --> 16:22.250
<b>Let's have us a mushroom party!</b>

16:22.250 --> 16:23.500
<b>What?!</b>

16:24.210 --> 16:27.380
<b>Eat up, c'mon! Mushrooms for all!</b>

16:27.880 --> 16:31.130
<b>I ended up spending the next day with the nerds, too.</b>

16:31.500 --> 16:34.920
<b>Guess not being a loner isn't so bad sometimes.</b>

16:38.500 --> 16:42.630
<b>Take care, then. Don't get hunted down by classmates.</b>

16:43.500 --> 16:44.880
<b>Not planning to!</b>

16:45.880 --> 16:48.670
<b>Are you sure you don't wanna come with?</b>

16:49.130 --> 16:54.170
<b>We're headed downriver to look for a town
and get started as adventurers.</b>

16:56.580 --> 17:00.580
<b>Out of our whole class,
you're probably more in our group than any.</b>

17:00.580 --> 17:02.670
<b>Yeah, true enough.</b>

17:03.170 --> 17:06.000
<b>We used to share books and stuff.</b>

17:06.630 --> 17:07.380
<b>Then-</b>

17:08.710 --> 17:09.920
<b>But I must decline!</b>

17:10.880 --> 17:12.250
<b>What?!</b>

17:12.540 --> 17:14.500
<b>Get going! Shoo!</b>

17:18.210 --> 17:23.580
<b>I'd love to head into town, but with my cursed set
of stats, I'd only hold 'em back.</b>

17:24.380 --> 17:27.040
<b>Better go check on the others.</b>

17:27.580 --> 17:30.000
<b>The nerds seemed worried about our Class Rep, after all.</b>

17:35.880 --> 17:38.210
<b>On the way there, I encountered a Kobold</b>

17:39.710 --> 17:40.750
<b>OUCH!</b>

17:42.040 --> 17:44.540
<b>Got bit a bit, but managed to win.</b>

17:45.040 --> 17:47.750
<b>And after walking around in pain a while...</b>

17:56.960 --> 17:59.710
<b>Place is empty. Did they move on?</b>

18:00.130 --> 18:01.880
<b>ENEMY DETECTION</b>

18:01.080 --> 18:01.880
<b>Huh?</b>

18:10.460 --> 18:11.290
<b>Are those...?</b>

18:16.880 --> 18:20.630
<b>W-well, then! Better head home and eat!</b>

18:20.830 --> 18:24.960
<b>What should I cook up today?
I could go for some fried chicken!</b>

18:24.960 --> 18:26.460
<b>Like, what's your deal?</b>

18:26.460 --> 18:27.710
<b>Wait right there!</b>

18:28.040 --> 18:29.210
<b>HEY!</b>

18:29.710 --> 18:33.250
<b>No thanks! You're the furthest thing
from a life of quiet solitude!</b>

18:33.500 --> 18:35.380
<b>Stop! Please!</b>

18:35.790 --> 18:37.540
<b>What? "Please?"</b>

18:37.750 --> 18:39.880
<b>That can't be right. Am I hearing things?</b>

18:40.290 --> 18:42.460
<b>You're friends with Oda's herd, right?!</b>

18:42.880 --> 18:45.540
<b>We're looking for them! If you've seen 'em, say so!</b>

18:46.170 --> 18:49.790
<b>Dunno about any Oda herd,
but I do know some otaku nerds.</b>

18:50.250 --> 18:52.920
<b>Yeah, same difference! Can you not?</b>

18:54.500 --> 18:57.130
<b>Why are you looking for the nerds, though?</b>

18:57.710 --> 18:59.000
<b>I bet you wanna put 'em to work--</b>

18:59.000 --> 19:00.830
<b>We just want to apologize!</b>

19:00.830 --> 19:01.580
<b>Wha...?</b>

19:04.040 --> 19:06.920
<b>We totally see what we did, now!</b>

19:06.920 --> 19:10.080
<b>We're only alive now thanks to them!</b>

19:10.460 --> 19:12.380
<b>Th-they seem serious...</b>

19:12.750 --> 19:16.630
<b>You'd never find them apologizing
back in the real world...</b>

19:18.420 --> 19:23.210
<b>Sorry to break it to you, but you'll
never catch or catch up to them.</b>

19:23.460 --> 19:25.830
<b>S-still, tell us what you know!</b>

19:28.040 --> 19:30.920
<b>Tell me, then, can you make it outta these woods?</b>

19:31.290 --> 19:32.460
<b>I mean...</b>

19:32.920 --> 19:34.330
<b>Can you fight monsters?</b>

19:35.250 --> 19:40.790
<b>Well? Are you going to go find your saviors
and apologize? Or are you gonna give up?</b>

19:41.080 --> 19:42.630
<b>I need an answer!</b>

19:43.210 --> 19:45.290
<b>I-I mean...</b>

19:45.540 --> 19:47.130
<b>It's one or the other!</b>

19:47.880 --> 19:51.920
<b>I'd be doing the nerds a disservice
if I didn't check if they mean it.</b>

19:55.040 --> 19:59.170
<b>Waaah! We just wanna apologize!</b>

19:59.500 --> 20:00.790
<b>We don't wanna die!</b>

20:00.790 --> 20:02.920
<b>The monsters are gonna eat us!</b>

20:02.920 --> 20:05.500
<b>Uhh, okay, what's going on, here?</b>

20:09.880 --> 20:14.540
<b>Please teach us all we need to know
to survive until we find them!</b>

20:14.540 --> 20:17.210
<b>Give us the strength to repent!</b>

20:17.540 --> 20:19.290
<b>To repay their favors!</b>

20:19.540 --> 20:21.080
<b>Please!</b>

20:21.710 --> 20:22.420
<b>Yeah?!</b>

20:23.170 --> 20:24.670
<b>SUBJUGATE</b>

20:24.880 --> 20:27.790
<b>Wait, my subjugation skill just activated?</b>

20:27.790 --> 20:29.710
<b>'Cause I technically said, "Yeah?"</b>

20:29.710 --> 20:31.710
<b>SUBJUGATION LIST</b>

20:29.710 --> 20:31.710
<b>Gal Leader</b>

20:29.710 --> 20:31.710
<b>Gal A</b>

20:29.710 --> 20:31.710
<b>Gal D</b>

20:31.710 --> 20:34.210
<b>How the heck did this happen?!</b>

20:34.210 --> 20:39.710
<b>Walk                       Talk</b>

20:34.210 --> 20:39.710
<b>Worry                 Lament</b>

20:34.210 --> 20:39.710
<b>Haruka         Gal Leader           Gal A        Gal D</b>

20:34.210 --> 20:39.710
<b>NEET                   JK                      JK            JK</b>

20:38.460 --> 20:39.710
<b>What are you, ducklings?!</b>

20:39.710 --> 20:41.830
<b>STARE</b>

20:41.830 --> 20:45.330
<b>Walk    Talk</b>

20:41.830 --> 20:45.330
<b>Worry  Lament</b>

20:42.080 --> 20:43.960
<b>Even if I try talking, that's all I get!</b>

20:43.960 --> 20:45.330
<b>What the heck is this subjugation thing?!</b>

20:45.330 --> 20:47.830
<b>CURRENTLY SUBJUGATED</b>

20:45.710 --> 20:47.630
<b>It's scary how little life is in their eyes...</b>

20:47.960 --> 20:50.290
<b>And how they'll finish baddies off without a word...</b>

20:50.290 --> 20:52.460
<b>It's terrifying! I'm gonna cry!</b>

20:53.250 --> 20:56.080
<b>And then they pull magic crystals off the monsters...</b>

20:56.330 --> 20:57.920
<b>And bring it to me like dogs with a frisbee!</b>

20:58.420 --> 20:59.170
<b>Hm?</b>

20:59.540 --> 21:02.080
<b>Are you hurt? Want a healing potion?</b>

21:06.170 --> 21:07.830
<b>I didn't need it!</b>

21:07.830 --> 21:10.500
<b>Ugh, and it's mushroom-flavored? It reeks!</b>

21:10.960 --> 21:15.580
<b>If our Class Rep saw us now, she'd flip her lid...</b>

21:15.920 --> 21:20.670
<b>Nag nag</b>

21:15.920 --> 21:20.670
<b>nag nag</b>

21:16.040 --> 21:20.000
<b>I've never been a match for her super class rep powers.</b>

21:20.920 --> 21:24.790
<b>What do I do? How do I cancel this subjugation thing?</b>

21:26.960 --> 21:28.500
<b>Haruka...?</b>

21:29.210 --> 21:30.130
<b>Haruka!</b>

21:30.130 --> 21:33.580
<b>Maybe it'll wear off 'cause I reek so bad from this potion?</b>

21:34.250 --> 21:37.210
<b>Maybe if I add in some more mushrooms next time...</b>

21:37.540 --> 21:40.380
<b>Hey! Hello? Hi?</b>

21:37.790 --> 21:39.540
<b>And then...</b>

21:40.380 --> 21:41.170
<b>Smelly...</b>

21:41.380 --> 21:42.380
<b>Gosh!</b>

21:43.130 --> 21:46.710
<b>HEY! HARUKA!</b>

21:46.710 --> 21:48.790
<b>Y-you're here!</b>

21:54.580 --> 21:56.080
<b>So, what's the plan?</b>

21:56.380 --> 21:59.380
<b>The girls are still stickin' round the old camp.</b>

22:00.790 --> 22:01.920
<b>Right.</b>

22:03.000 --> 22:06.580
<b>First thing's first, we get rid of our problems.</b>
